<title>USA: TABLE - P &amp; F Industries Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - P &amp; F Industries Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2			   Six Months</p>
<p>		   1997	    1996	   1997	    1996</p>
<p>Revs    $ 10,643,323  $ 9,691,210   $19,861,131    $19,067,635</p>
<p>Net     $    487,038  $   355,796   $   848,512    $   706,089</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>	     3,472,197    3,215,884     3,473,183	3,188,124</p>
<p>Net Per Class A Share</p>
<p>		   $0.14	  $0.09	   $0.24	    $0.18</p>
<p>NOTE:  P &amp; F Industries Inc said it paid preferred dividends of $21,857 in the 1997 six months, $65,837 and $131,673, respectively, for the 1996 quarter and six months.</p>
</text>
